      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "YES PLEASE! I've been treated very unfairly by prejudiced staff in a couple groups and I couldn't even defend myself because the staff (who eventually kicked me) had me MUTED (Which is highly unprofessional). If I block a group, I don't want to have to see it anymore!",
