  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've been playing VRChat for a long time now, ive seen some groups that personally upset me and others I know of whether its in the name or just the people apart of it. \n\nI noticed when you have a group blocked you can still see their instances pop up in your friend tab if friends are in them or if its a group public. I'd really appreciate if that were to be changed so you cant see anything related to a group thats blocked unless searched for.\n\nAlso make it to where you can block groups in game rather then having to go on the webiste.",
